Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the Binary Response Writer not correctly handling wildcard fields in queries, leading to situations where these fields were not being returned in the response. This was due to an oversight in the conditional logic that determined whether only pseudo fields were being requested, which failed to account for cases where wildcard patterns were included.

